Subject: A member bounds parked publishes and never redirects to itself
Why: CP-T2.2 publisher-after-kill step 2: stale self hints hold a publish until serving, another leader or its bounded wait; no room and expiry answer no available leader. Fenced members release publisher lanes before replacement in deterministic order. Ported from Focal cp/t2.2-publisher-hold commit 28dde69e, authorized by Ada to land the fix ourselves.

